findings.proposedFix:
Derive the run's folders from its args, which every record has:
- the start snapshot's folder from `args.snapshotPath`, relative to `args.repoRoot`;
- in `run check`, any path under `agent-os/specs/<stamp>-<pr>-review-round-` or `agent-os/specs/<stamp>-<pr>-human-review-`, with `<stamp>` taken from `args.launchedAt` (the workflow's `specFolderFor` and `humanFolderFor`).

Add prefs-test cases:
- a no-result record with an untracked `<folder>/redline/snapshot-start.json`: check is ok;
- an error record listing only round 1, with untracked round-2 review files: check is ok;
- a stray file outside the run's folders: still refused.
